# Flutter files are in the release




Name : Our-Air (RePitched)

I`m designing : a enviroment monitering network that uses high end 
sensors: bme690 sgp41 scd41
the project is split into 3 parts 
Part 1:Node:  Pcb its a 4 layer pcb with teardrops and thermal decepation  and planes, the Mcu is a esp32 c3 u1 n4 with an external antenna IPX connect around 5-6 edbi ,charger ic is ip2312 set to 3A charging(practicly 2.92A) charging 2 18650s in a p configuration
, buck and boost ic tps63802DLAT  it has a VIN of 1.2v to 5.5v and Vout of 3.3V to be able to  turn the 18650 3.7v to 3.3v and the usb 5v to 3.3v its around 80% effecincy and Sensors are the Bme690 bosch latest environmet sensor for its 
accuracy and Sgp41 by senisiron for NOX meassurements and Scd41 by senisiron for True c02 sensing, Cad Casing it is a simple case with many holes and great breathability
the closing mechanism is a snap fit that actualy holdes  the wall thickness is 3mm which holdes well and the snap fit plastic tip is 2mm, Software , it has a deep sleep of 15min then it wakes up to init the sensors then goes to light sleep
for 20s to give the sensors time to sense ,then  reads the ddata puts it in a JSON packet then sends with espnow set to Long Range Broadcast Mode , power consumption is an average of around 150uA (flashing code is with a ch340k programmer in the pcb also used for debugging)
Part 2:Master : Pcb its a 4 layer pcb with teardrops and thermal decepation  and planes the Mcu is a esp32 c3 u1 n4 with an external antenna IPX connecter around 5-6 edbi ,charger ic is ip2312 set to 3A charging(practicly 2.92A) 
charging 2 backup 18650s in a p configuration, buck and boost ic tps63802DLAT  it has a VIN of 1.2v to 5.5v and Vout of 3.3V to be able to  turn the 18650 3.7v to 3.3v and the usb 5v to 3.3v its around 95% effecincy
and RTC ic Ds3231SN for timestamps  and Sd card port set to Spi to make the EAV sqlite db and write data,cad case its vary similar to the node one same closing mechanism same wall thickness just its just a little bigger 
with more ports and less breathability  which isnt needed, Software the master is also set to reciever long range broadcast mode and uses a smart queue system to avoid blockage when writing to Database sqlite, it reads the packet
deserializes it reads timestamp from RTC ic and  macaddress and location from packet then prepares a full packet  and sends it to queue and another function writes the fullpacket in a EAV structure sqlite DB thats on the sd card,also it 
writes to usb to read live data 
Part 3 : Flutter desktop apps, there are 2 apps, first one  where you add the db path  and you choose location and reading type and it graphs the data  also it has a manualy Sqlite query Codefield with a limit of 300 rows(becuase any higher
freezes my pc) in the second app you select a usb port that automaticly only shows ones that are connected to an ch340k ic, you can select the master or a node the app checks for a "reading :" if the theprint sent has it it shows it in the 
live node data Field and below the live node data field is a debug monitor that shows all prints you connect a node to debug it (or master)
What makes my project unique -
1 Its fully open source , This project does`nt have to be just a project people cant use or learn from

-2 The sensors all have 2 common reading and those are the humidity and temperature, and this lets us compare sensor data to detect faulty sensors

-3 Community driven nodes that the smart system adds to its network

-4 Achieving Long Range without a Lora IC, our system uses a broadcasting esp-now interface with range up to 1.5km

-5 No encryption to the sent packets and broadcast mode, this lets solo researchers and tech hobbyists check their local environment data , even build their own project around the sensor data

-6 Very versatile the system is dynamic so it can read multiple kinds of data , For example someone can make one that watches water level at a nearby lake, Or someone can make a bracelet with a button to notify 
the nearby receiver when that the person wearing the bracelet is lost this is the Reason of the EAV structure,

